--- text
Confirm your new email address

A request was made to change the email address on the
[PRODUCT_NAME] account from [OLD_EMAIL_ADDRESS] to
[NEW_EMAIL_ADDRESS]. We sent this message to the new address to
check that it reaches you. We have also sent a notice of this
request to the old address.

Confirm this address:

[CTA_URL]

This link expires at [EXPIRY_ABSOLUTE] - [EXPIRY_RELATIVE] after it
was sent.

Important: The change does not take effect until you confirm from
this address. Until then, [OLD_EMAIL_ADDRESS] stays the address on
the account. If you did not ask for this, do not confirm: ignore
this email and nothing changes on the account.

We will never ask you for your password by email. If anything here
looks wrong, reply to this email, or write to [SUPPORT_EMAIL]. A
real person reads every message.

[SIGNOFF_NAME], [COMPANY_NAME]
